# Nothing generated or stateful belongs in git for the PoC.
#
# NOTE: this is the OPPOSITE of the real repository's convention, where
# generated `_*.tf` IS committed and guarded by the G0 gate and CODEOWNERS
# (see CLAUDE.md, "Conventions"). Here the tree is a source-only fixture that
# run-poc.sh copies elsewhere to execute, so committing generated output would
# only create drift with nothing to check it against.
_*.tf
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
stacks/_probe/
